{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09241","headline":"冬夜宿司空曙野居因寄酬赠 · 韦应物","name":"冬夜宿司空曙野居因寄酬赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南北与山邻，蓬庵庇一身。\n繁霜疑有雪，荒草似无人。\n遂性在耕稼，所交唯贱贫。\n何掾张椽傲，每重德璋亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}